c equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\nr=⟨2,-3,5⟩+s⟨2,4,1⟩+t⟨1,3,-1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "2b43f3008aab14f6a953bf33be3ba0cd83395466755dcafc72234ad29f35bc13"} {"question" "q-128463" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec258eb6c94dc1549530bb4230d77e0f72728e5d4939a4eec01690d066a25c19"} {"question" "q-128463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "2b43f3008aab14f6a953bf33be3ba0cd83395466755dcafc72234ad29f35bc13"} {"question" "q-128463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "r=⟨2,-3,5⟩+s⟨2,4,1⟩+t⟨1,3,-1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=⟨2,-5,3⟩+s⟨2,4,1⟩+t⟨3,-1,1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=⟨2,-5,3⟩+s⟨4,2,1⟩+t⟨1,3,-1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=⟨2,3,5⟩+s⟨1,-4,2⟩+t⟨1,3,1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=⟨2,5,3⟩+s⟨-2,4,1⟩+t⟨3,1,-1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "2b43f3008aab14f6a953bf33be3ba0cd83395466755dcafc72234ad29f35bc13"} {"question" "q-128463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "r=⟨2,-3,5⟩+s⟨2,4,1⟩+t⟨1,3,-1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "2b43f3008aab14f6a953bf33be3ba0cd83395466755dcafc72234ad29f35bc13"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find a normal vector to the plane\n\n$$\nr=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+s[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,t,\\,s\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "2b43f3008aab14f6a953bf33be3ba0cd83395466755dcafc72234ad29f35bc13"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the parametric equation, we have that $v=⟨-5,1,1⟩$ and $w=⟨3,1,-2⟩$ are parallel to the plane.\n\nNow, we need to find a normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of $v$ and $w$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-3i-7j-8k \\\\  & =⟨-3,-7,-8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-3,-7,-8⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "2b43f3008aab14f6a953bf33be3ba0cd83395466755dcafc72234ad29f35bc13"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec258eb6c94dc1549530bb4230d77e0f72728e5d4939a4eec01690d066a25c19"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" 